    "key_findings": [
      "Integrating a Transformer-based context-aware re-ranking mechanism into Learning to Rank (LTR) cross-sectional currency momentum strategies increases Sharpe ratios by approximately 30% on average.",
      "Context-aware ranking models accurately select currency instruments more precisely across both normal and risk-off market environments, resulting in substantially enhanced performance during critical risk-off episodes.",
      "LambdaMART generally dominates other baseline rankers across most performance measures among traditional LTR models.",
      "Context-aware LTR models consistently improve cumulative wealth and performance statistics compared to standard global LTR baselines."
    ],
